step The Stormrage Barrow Dens
  only Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Tauren: the Great Cat Spirit waits on the southern hill above the bridge. Skyborne: the Avatar of Saeyleenan stands south of the twin bridges. Then the dens east of the lake: leave your form, click the statue at the entrance for five minutes of stealth, keep clear of the spirits inside and take one of each relic; the Relic of the Silent Shadow lies at the foot of the white cat statue. Careful: the spirits are Territorial Terrans (level 60) that kill whoever they see: stay off their paths, and click the statue again before the stealth runs out.
  turnin 98405 only Tauren @54.5,75 map 1450 era -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98342 only Tauren @54.5,75 map 1450 era
  turnin 98341 only Skyborne          -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98404 only Skyborne
